{"id": "7th-t2-u1-q026", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "2", "unit_id": "ta-t2-u1-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-naladiyar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t2-u1-odd-naladiyar-terms", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நாலடியார் 'அழியாச் செல்வம்' பாடலில் குறிப்பிடப்படும் கல்விச் செல்வத்தின் இயல்புகளில் பொருந்தாத ஒன்றைக் கண்டறிக:"}], "options": {"A": "வைத்த இடத்தில் பிறரால் கொள்ளப்படாது (திருடப்படாது)", "B": "ஒருவர் விரும்பிக் கொடுத்தாலும் குறைவுபடாது", "C": "கோபமுற்ற வல்லரசராலும் பறித்துக் கொள்ள முடியாது", "D": "நாட்கள் செல்லச் செல்ல இயல்பாகவே தேய்ந்து அழியும்"}, "explanation": "நாலடியார் கூற்றுப்படி கல்வி அழியாச் செல்வமாகும் ('வைப்புழிக் கோட்படா வாய்த்தீயிற் கேடில்லை'). அது அழியும் என்று கூறுவது தவறானது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Find the statement that does not correspond to the attributes of educational wealth in Naladiyar's 'Azhiyaach Selvam':"}], "options": {"A": "Cannot be stolen or taken from where it is stored", "B": "Does not decrease when generously imparted", "C": "Cannot be confiscated even by enraged mighty monarchs", "D": "Gradually diminishes and vanishes with the passage of time"}, "explanation": "Education is immortal ('Azhiyaach Selvam') and never diminishes or fades with time. Hence option D is false and the odd one out."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "2", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 2, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["odd_one_out", "naladiyar"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t2-u1-q027", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "2", "unit_id": "ta-t2-u1-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-thottapattu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t2-u1-thottapattu-bookback1", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "முற்காலத்தில் இந்திய மக்கள் துன்பப்பட்டதற்குக் காரணமானது எது இல்லாதமை என்று தேயிலைத் தோட்டப் பாட்டு குறிப்பிடுகிறது?"}], "options": {"A": "விளையாட்டு", "B": "கல்வி", "C": "கலைகள்", "D": "முயற்சி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் மதிப்பீடு வினா: முற்காலத்தில் இந்திய மக்கள் துன்பப்பட்டதற்குக் காரணம் 'கல்வி' இல்லாமையே ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to the Tea Garden Song, the historical suffering of Indian people was caused primarily by the absence of what?"}], "options": {"A": "Sports", "B": "Education", "C": "Arts", "D": "Effort"}, "explanation": "As formulated in the textbook evaluation exercise, lack of 'education' (Kalvi) was the primary reason for historical exploitation."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "2", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 6, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_