{"id": "7th-t3-u4-q389", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-thirunelveli", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-pyq-sambandar-quote-completion", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC மேற்கோளை நிறைவு செய்க:\n'திக்கெல்லாம் புகழுறும் திருநெல்வேலி' என்று பாடியவர் __________ ஆவார்."}], "options": {"A": "திருஞானசம்பந்தர்", "B": "திருநாவுக்கரசர்", "C": "சுந்தரர்", "D": "மாணிக்கவாசகர்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 4: 'திக்கெல்லாம் புகழுறும் திருநெல்வேலி' என்று பாடியவர் திருஞானசம்பந்தர் ஆவார் (தேவாரம்). டிஎன்பிஎஸ்சி தேர்வுகளில் பலமுறை கேட்கப்பட்ட பொன்மொழி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Complete the famous TNPSC quotation:\n'Thikkellam pugazhurum Tirunelveli' was sung by __________."}], "options": {"A": "Thiru-gnana-sambandar", "B": "Thirunavukkarasar", "C": "Sundarar", "D": "Manikkavasagar"}, "explanation": "Page 4: 'Thikkellam pugazhurum Tirunelveli' was sung by Thirugnanasambandar in his Thevaram hymns."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "3", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 4, "chapter": nul