{"id": "7th-t3-u4-q390", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-puthumai-vilakku", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-pyq-muthal-azhwars-odd-one-out", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "வைணவ நெறியில் 'முதலாழ்வார்கள்' மூவரில் பொருந்தாத வேறுபட்ட ஒருவர் யார்?"}], "options": {"A": "பொய்கையாழ்வார்", "B": "நம்மாழ்வார்", "C": "பூதத்தாழ்வார்", "D": "பேயாழ்வார்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 21: பொய்கையாழ்வார், பூதத்தாழ்வார், பேயாழ்வார் ஆகிய மூவரே 'முதலாழ்வார்கள்' எனப் போற்றப்படுகின்றனர். நம்மாழ்வார் முதலாழ்வார்களில் ஒருவர் அல்லர் (இவர் சடகோபர் என அழைக்கப்பட்டு திருவாய்மொழி பாடியவர்). எனவே நம்மாழ்வார் பொருந்தாதவர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who among the following Azhwars does NOT belong to the group of three 'First Azhwars'?"}], "options": {"A": "Poigai Azhwar", "B": "Nammazhwar", "C": "Boothathazhwar", "D": "Peyazhwar"}, "explanation": "Page 21: The three First Azhwars are Poigai, Bootham, and Peyazhwar. Nammazhwar is not one of the Muthal Azhwars. Hence B is the odd one."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class":