{"id": "8th-booster-q1313", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-scholars", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kayidhe-millath-quote-completion", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அடிக்கோடிட்ட தொடரை நிரப்புக:\n\"'காயிதே மில்லத்' என்னும் அரபுச் சொல்லுக்கு '______ தலைவர்' என்பது பொருள் ஆகும்\""}], "options": {"A": "வழிகாட்டும்", "B": "சமூக", "C": "அரசியல்", "D": "புரட்சி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 170: 'காயிதே மில்லத் என்னும் அரபுச் சொல்லுக்கு வழிகாட்டும் தலைவர் என்பது பொருள்'. விடுபட்ட சொல் 'வழிகாட்டும்'."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Fill in the blank regarding the meaning of Quaid-e-Millath:\n\"The Arabic title 'Quaid-e-Millath' signifies '______ Leader'\":"}], "options": {"A": "Guiding (Vazhikaattum)", "B": "Social (Samooga)", "C": "Political (Arasiyal)", "D": "Revolutionary (Puratchi)"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 170: Quaid-e-Millath in Arabic translates to 'Guiding Leader'. The missing word is 'Vazhikaattum'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2