{"id": "8th-u3-q363", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u3-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-14-palthuraikkalvi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u3-direct-science-kozhukombu-quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "புற உலக ஆராய்ச்சிக்கு 'அறிவியல்' எதனைப் போன்றது எனத் திரு.வி.க. பல்துறைக்கல்வி பகுதியில் உருவகிக்கிறார்?"}], "options": {"A": "ஆழமான ஆணிவேர் போன்றது", "B": "வானளாவிய கோபுரம் போன்றது", "C": "கொழுகொம்பு போன்றது", "D": "கலங்காத கலங்கரை விளக்கம் போன்றது"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 54, 55 நிரப்புக வினா 2: 'புற உலக ஆராய்ச்சிக்கு அறிவியல் கொழுகொம்பு போன்றது'."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "To what object does Thiru. Vi. Ka. liken 'Science' in relation to external empirical research?"}], "options": {"A": "Deep taproot", "B": "Sky-scraping tower", "C": "Supporting trellis / prop (Kozhukombu)", "D": "Unwavering lighthouse"}, "explanation": "Textbook pages 54, 55 fill in the blank question 2: 'Science is like a supporting trellis (கொழுகொம்பு) for investigating the physical universe'. Option C is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporatio