{"id": "9th-u2-q011", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-neerindri-amaiyaadhu-ulagu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-cotton-kallanai-research-year", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆங்கிலேயப் பொறியியலாளர் சர் ஆர்தர் காட்டன் காவிரிப் பாசனப் பகுதிக்குத் தனிப் பொறுப்பாளராக நியமிக்கப்பட்ட ஆண்டு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1816", "B": "1820", "C": "1829", "D": "1856"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 26: 1829-ஆம் ஆண்டு காவிரிப் பாசனப் பகுதிக்குத் தனிப் பொறுப்பாளராக சர் ஆர்தர் காட்டன் நியமிக்கப்பட்டார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which year was Sir Arthur Cotton officially appointed by the British administration as the chief supervisor for Kaveri river delta irrigation?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1816", "B": "1820", "C": "1829", "D": "1856"}, "explanation": "Page 26 records that Cotton was appointed in 1829 to investigate the siltation crisis in the Kaveri delta."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 26, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 26", "u