{"id": "9th-u3-q027", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-eru-thazhuvuthal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-eru-thazhuvuthal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பழந்தமிழகத்தில் ஏறு தழுவுதலுக்கு வழங்கப்பட்ட மற்றொரு தொன்மையான பெயர் 'ஏறுகோள்' என்பதை உறுதிப்படுத்தும் இலக்கண நூல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நன்னூல்", "B": "அகத்தியம்", "C": "புறப்பொருள் வெண்பாமாலை", "D": "வீரசோழியம்"}, "explanation": "புறப்பொருள் வெண்பாமாலை என்னும் இலக்கண நூலில் 'ஏறுகோள்' என்னும் துறையில் காளையைத் தழுவும் வீர முறை விரிவாகக் கூறப்பட்டுள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which grammatical work confirms 'Erugol' as the ancient formal classical name for bull capture?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Nannool", "B": "Agathiyam", "C": "Purapporul Venbaamaalai", "D": "Veerasozhiyam"}, "explanation": "Purapporul Venbaamaalai explicitly designates this martial theme as 'Erugol' (grasping/taming the bull)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 51, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 51", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_3", "eru_thazhuvuthal", "sanga_ilakkiyam"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u3-q028", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-eru-thazhuvuthal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-eru-thazhuvuthal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழரின் ஏறு தழுவுதலுக்கும் மேலைநாட்டு காளைச் சண்டைக்கும் உள்ள அடிப்படை அறநெறி வேறுபாடு யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தமிழர் விளையாட்டில் பரிசுகள் வழங்கப்பட மாட்டாது", "B": "மேலைநாட்டு விளையாட்டில் விலங்குகள் வழிபடப்படுகின்றன", "C": "இரு விளையாட்டுகளிலும் ஆயுதங்கள் சமமாகப் பயன்படுத்தப்படுகின்றன", "D": "தமிழர் விளையாட்டில் எந்த ஆயுதமும் இன்றி அன்பும் வீரமும் மேலோங்கக் காளையைக் கொல்லாமல் தழுவுவர்; மேலைநாட்டில் ஆயுதத்தால் காளையைக் கொன்று வீழ்த்துவர்"}, "explanation": "மேலைநாட்டு காளைச் சண்டையில் காளையைக் கொன்று அடக்குவர், ஆயுதங்களைப் பயன்படுத்துவர். ஆனால் தமிழரின் ஏறு தழுவுதலில் எந்த ஆயுதமும் பயன்படுத்தக் கூடாது; காளைக்கு வழிபாடு செய்வர்; அன்பையும் வீரத்தையும் ஒருசேர வெளிப்படுத்துவர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the fundamental ethical divergence between Tamil Eru Thazhuvuthal and Western bullfighting?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "No prizes are awarded in Tamil sports", "B": "Animals are worshipped in Western bullfighting", "C": "Weapons are equally utilized in both arenas", "D": "Tamils use no weapons and embrace the bull without harming it with affection and valor; Western bullfighting employs lethal weapons to slaughter the animal"}, "explanation": "Western bullfighting is a lethal gladiatorial contest slaughtering the animal; Tamil Eru Thazhuvuthal is an unarmed sport celebrating mutual affection, reverence, and raw bravery."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 53, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 53", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_3", "eru_thazhuvuthal", "sanga_ilakkiyam"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}

