{"id": "9th-u3-q058", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-manimekalai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-manimekalai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மணிமேகலை காப்பியத்தை இயற்றிய மதுரைக் கூலவாணிகன் சீத்தலைச் சாத்தனாரின் இயற்பெயர் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சாத்தப்பன்", "B": "சாத்தன்", "C": "சீத்தலை", "D": "கூலவாணிகன்"}, "explanation": "சீத்தலைச் சாத்தனாரின் இயற்பெயர் 'சாத்தன்' என்பதாகும். சீத்தலை என்பது இவர் பிறந்த ஊர்; கூல வாணிகம் செய்ததால் மதுரைக் கூலவாணிகன் சீத்தலைச் சாத்தனார் எனப் பெயர் பெற்றார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What was the personal birth name of poet Seethalai Saathanaar, the author of Manimekalai?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Saathappan", "B": "Saathan", "C": "Seethalai", "D": "Koolavaanigan"}, "explanation": "His personal name was 'Saathan'; hailing from Seethalai and trading in grain (koolam) in Madurai, he became known as Madurai Koolavaanigan Seethalai Saathanaar."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 56, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference":