{"id": "9th-u3-q065", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-manimekalai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-manimekalai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "காவிரிப்பூம்பட்டினத்தில் நடைபெற்ற இந்திர விழா எத்தனை நாட்கள் தொடர்ந்து கொண்டாடப்படும் என்று மணிமேகலை குறிப்பிடுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "28 நாட்கள் (நாலேழ் நாள்)", "B": "18 நாட்கள்", "C": "14 நாட்கள்", "D": "30 நாட்கள்"}, "explanation": "மணிமேகலை அடி 67: 'தேவரும் மக்களும் ஒத்துடன் திரிதரும் நாலேழ் நாளினும் நன்கறிந்தீர் என' - நாலேழ் நாள் என்பது 4 x 7 = 28 நாட்கள் ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to Manimekalai, for how many days was the grand Indra festival celebrated in Poompuhar?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "28 days (Naalaezh naal: 4 x 7)", "B": "18 days", "C": "14 days", "D": "30 days"}, "explanation": "The poem states 'Naalaezh naal' (four times seven), indicating the festive carnival continued uninterrupted for 28 days."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 55, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference":