{"id": "9th-u5-q065", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ravana-kaviyam-vocab-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (சொல்லும் பொருளும்):\n(a) கடறு - 1. காடு\n(b) புலம் - 2. வயல்\n(c) தாமம் - 3. மாலை\n(d) உளை - 4. பிடரிமயிர்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1"}, "explanation": "சரியான பொருத்தம்: கடறு - காடு; புலம் - வயல்; தாமம் - மாலை; உளை - பிடரிமயிர் (குதிரை/சிங்கத்தின் பிடரிமயிர்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the classical words with their meanings:\n(a) Kadaru - 1. Forest\n(b) Pulam - 2. Cultivated field\n(c) Thaamam - 3. Garland\n(d) Ulai - 4. Mane (of horse/lion)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1"}, "explanation": "Accurate mapping: Kadaru = Forest; Pulam = Field; Thaamam = Garland; Ulai = Mane."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9",