{"id": "9th-u7-q080", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "sivaka-chinthamani-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (சீவக சிந்தாமணிச் சொற்கள் - பொருள்கள்):\n(a) தெங்கு - 1. உச்சி\n(b) வருக்கை - 2. பாய்ந்து\n(c) நெற்றி - 3. தேங்காய்\n(d) மடுத்து - 4. பலாப்பழம்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "B": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-4, (d)-3", "C": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-3, (d)-4", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2"}, "explanation": "தெங்கு = தேங்காய் (3); வருக்கை = பலாப்பழம் (4); நெற்றி = உச்சி (1); மடுத்து = பாய்ந்து (2). சரியான வரிசை: 3, 4, 1, 2."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the classical vocabulary terms from Sivaka Chinthamani with their meanings:\n(a) Thengu - 1. Summit / Crown\n(b) Varukkai - 2. Flowing forth\n(c) Netri - 3. Coconut\n(d) Madhuthu - 4. Jackfruit", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "B": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-4, (d)-3", "C": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-3, (d)-4", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2"}, "explanation": "Thengu -> Coconut (3); Varukkai -> Jackfruit (4); Netri -> Summit (1); Madhuthu -> Flowing forth (2). Sequence: 3, 4, 1, 2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name