{"id": "9th-u7-q088", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "muthollayiram-source-anthology", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "முத்தொள்ளாயிரத்தின் முழுமையான 900 பாடல்களும் கிடைக்காத நிலையில், இந்நூலின் 108 பாடல்கள் எந்தத் தொகை நூலின் வாயிலாக நமக்குக் கிடைத்துள்ளன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நற்றிணை", "B": "அகநானூறு", "C": "கலித்தொகை", "D": "புறத்திரட்டு"}, "explanation": "முத்தொள்ளாயிர நூல் முழுமையாகக் கிடைக்கவில்லை. 'புறத்திரட்டு' என்னும் செய்யுள் தொகுப்பு நூலிலிருந்தே நமக்கு 108 பாடல்கள் கிடைத்துள்ளன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "As the entire 900 verses are lost, through which medieval anthology were 108 verses of Muthollayiram salvaged and preserved?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Narrinai", "B": "Akananuru", "C": "Kalithogai", "D": "Purathirattu (புறத்திரட்டு)"}, "explanation": "The surviving 108 verses of Muthollayiram were recovered from the medieval anthology 'Purathirattu'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 137, "chapter": null, "section": null, "r