{"id": "9th-u7-q098", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "moovendhar-garland-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (மன்னர்கள் - அடையாள மாலைகள்):\n(a) சேரன் - 1. ஆத்தி மாலை\n(b) சோழன் - 2. வேப்பம்பூ மாலை\n(c) பாண்டியன் - 3. பனம்பூ மாலை", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3", "B": "(a)-3, (b)-1, (c)-2", "C": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-1", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-2, (c)-1"}, "explanation": "சேரன் = பனம்பூ மாலை (3); சோழன் = ஆத்தி மாலை (1); பாண்டியன் = வேப்பம்பூ மாலை (2). சரியான வரிசை: 3, 1, 2."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the three crowned kings with their identifying royal flower garlands:\n(a) Cheran - 1. Athi garland\n(b) Cholan - 2. Neem flower garland\n(c) Pandiyan - 3. Palmyra blossom garland", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3", "B": "(a)-3, (b)-1, (c)-2", "C": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-1", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-2, (c)-1"}, "explanation": "Cheran -> Palmyra (3); Cholan -> Athi (1); Pandiyan -> Neem (2). Match: 3, 1, 2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition":