{"id": "9th-u7-q106", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "muthollayiram-true-false", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "முத்தொள்ளாயிரம் பற்றிய கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\nI. இந்நூல் சேர, சோழ, பாண்டிய மூவேந்தர்களைப் பாடுகிறது.\nII. இது ஆசிரியப்பாவால் இயற்றப்பட்டது.\nIII. இதன் 108 பாடல்கள் புறத்திரட்டு வழியாகக் கிடைத்துள்ளன.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று I, II, III அனைத்தும் சரி", "B": "கூற்று I, III சரி; கூற்று II தவறு (வெண்பா)", "C": "கூற்று I மட்டும் சரி", "D": "கூற்று II மட்டும் சரி"}, "explanation": "கூற்று I மற்றும் III சரி. கூற்று II தவறு; ஏனெனில் முத்தொள்ளாயிரம் 'வெண்பா' யாப்பால் பாடப்பட்டது (ஆசிரியப்பா அன்று)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the statements on Muthollayiram:\nI. It sings praises of the Three Monarchs.\nII. It is composed in Aasiriyappa meter.\nIII. 108 verses are preserved via Purathirattu.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Statements I, II, and III are all correct", "B": "Statements I and III are correct; statement II is incorrect (Composed in Venba)", "C": "Only statement I is correct", "D": "Only statement II is correct"}, "explanation": "Statements I and III are true. Statement II is incorrect as Muthollayiram is composed in Venba meter, not Aasiriyappa."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 137, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 137", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_7", "muthollayiram", "analytical"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u7-q107", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "chola-war-elephant-sea", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "முத்தொள்ளாயிரத்தில் சோழ நாட்டின் யானைகள் எங்கு சென்று விளையாடுவதாகப் புலவர் கற்பனை நயத்தோடு பாடுகிறார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மணல் மேடுகளில்", "B": "மலை உச்சியில்", "C": "கடல் அலைகளில் பாய்ந்து விளையாடுவதாக", "D": "காட்டு மரங்களின் நிழலில்"}, "explanation": "சோழ நாட்டின் கலிங்கத்துப் போர் யானைகளும் இளம் கன்றுகளும் கடலில் பாயும் அலைகளை எதிர்த்து நின்று விளையாடும் காட்சியைக் கவிஞர் நயம்பட உரைக்கிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Where does the poet fancifully envision the war elephants and calves of the Chola kingdom frolicking in play?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "On desert dunes", "B": "On mountain peaks", "C": "Surging through ocean surf and coastal sea waves (கடல் அலைகளில்)", "D": "Beneath forest shade"}, "explanation": "The poet depicts Chola elephants frolicking playfully amidst breaking ocean waves along the Coromandel coast."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 137, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 137", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_7", "chola", "elephant_play"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u7-q108", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "three-monarchs-collective-title", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ் மண்ணை ஆண்ட சேர, சோழ, பாண்டிய மன்னர்களைத் தமிழ் இலக்கியங்கள் ஒன்றிணைத்து எவ்வாறு அழைக்கின்றன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கடை ஏழு வள்ளல்கள்", "B": "ஐம்பெருங்குழுவினர்", "C": "எண்பேராயத்தினர்", "D": "மூவேந்தர்கள்"}, "explanation": "பண்டைத் தமிழ்நாட்டின் மூன்று பெரும்பகுதிகளையும் ஆட்சி புரிந்த சேர, சோழ, பாண்டிய மன்னர்கள் 'மூவேந்தர்கள்' என்று அழைக்கப்பட்டனர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What collective honorific title do classical Tamil literary traditions accord to the Chera, Chola, and Pandya monarchs?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "The Seven Philanthropists", "B": "The Fivefold Royal Council", "C": "The Eightfold Executive Body", "D": "Moovendhargal (மூவேந்தர்கள் - The Three Crowned Kings)"}, "explanation": "The Chera, Chola, and Pandya sovereigns are immortalized in Tamil literature as the 'Moovendhargal'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 137, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 137", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_7", "moovendhar", "collective_name"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u7-q109", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "chera-kuda-nadu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சேர மன்னன் ஆண்ட மேற்கு நிலப்பகுதி சங்க காலத்தில் எவ்வாறு அழைக்கப்பட்டது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "குடநாடு", "B": "புனல் நாடு", "C": "தொண்டை நாடு", "D": "பாண்டி நாடு"}, "explanation": "சேர மன்னன் ஆண்ட மேற்குத் தொடர்ச்சி மலை சார்ந்த நிலப்பகுதி 'குடநாடு' (மேற்கு நாடு) என அழைக்கப்பட்டது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How was the western coastal and mountainous kingdom of the Cheras designated during the Sangam era?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kudanadu (குடநாடு - The Western Realm)", "B": "Punal Nadu", "C": "Thondai Nadu", "D": "Pandya Nadu"}, "explanation": "The Chera dominion was called Kudanadu ('Kuda' meaning West in classical Tamil)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 137, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 137", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "