{"id": "9th-u9-q060", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pen-names-genre-distinction", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கல்யாணசுந்தரம் அவர்கள் சிறுகதைகள் மற்றும் புதினங்களை எந்தப் பெயரிலும், கவிதைகளை எந்தப் பெயரிலும் எழுதியுள்ளார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சிறுகதைகளை சுஜாதா எனவும், கவிதைகளை வண்ணதாசன் எனவும்", "B": "சிறுகதைகளை பிரபஞ்சன் எனவும், கவிதைகளை கல்யாண்ஜி எனவும்", "C": "இரண்டையுமே வண்ணதாசன் என்ற ஒரே பெயரில் மட்டுமே", "D": "சிறுகதைகளை 'வண்ணதாசன்' என்ற பெயரிலும், கவிதைகளை 'கல்யாண்ஜி' என்ற பெயரிலும்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: கல்யாணசுந்தரம் சிறுகதைகளை 'வண்ணதாசன்' என்ற புனைப்பெயரிலும், கவிதைகளை 'கல்யாண்ஜி' என்ற புனைப்பெயரிலும் எழுதித் தமிழ் இலக்கியத்திற்குச் செழுமை சேர்த்துள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Under which distinct pseudonyms did Kalyanasundaram publish his short fiction versus his poetry?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Sujatha for stories, Vannadasan for poetry", "B": "Prapanchan for stories, Kalyanji for poetry", "C": "Vannadasan exclusively for both genres", "D": "'Vannadasan' for short stories and 'Kalyanji' for poetry"}, "explanation": "He adopts the pen name Vannadasan for fiction and Kalyanji for poetry."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 179, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 179", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "kalyanji", "pen_names"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q061", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kalyanji-poetry-collections", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கல்யாண்ஜியின் புகழ்பெற்ற கவிதைத் தொகுப்புகளுள் சரியான வரிசை எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "புலரி, முன்பின், ஆதி, அந்நியமற்ற நதி, மணல் உள்ள ஆறு", "B": "கொடிவழி, சூரியகாந்தி, நிலவுப்பூ", "C": "நெருஞ்சி, காகித மலர், குருவிப்பறவை", "D": "மழைக்காலக் குறிப்புகள், தேன்மழை, தீக்குச்சிகள்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூலில் குறிப்பிடப்பட்டுள்ள கல்யாண்ஜியின் கவிதைத் தொகுப்புகள்: புலரி, முன்பின், ஆதி, அந்நியமற்ற நதி, மணல் உள்ள ஆறு ஆகியவை ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which option accurately lists the celebrated poetry collections authored by Kalyanji as noted in the textbook?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Pulari, Munpin, Aathi, Anniyamatra Nadhi, Manal Ulla Aaru (புலரி, முன்பின், ஆதி...)", "B": "Kodivazhi, Sooriyakanthi, Nilavuppoo", "C": "Nerunji, Kaagitha Malar, Kuruvipparavai", "D": "Mazhaikkaala Kurippugal, Thaenmazhai, Theekkuchigal"}, "explanation": "Kalyanji's poetry anthologies include Pulari, Munpin, Aathi, Anniyamatra Nadhi, and Manal Ulla Aaru."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 179, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 179", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "kalyanji", "poetry_collections"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q062", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "akkarai-poem-central-theme", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"சைக்கிளில் தக்காளிப் பழங்கள் உருள... / யாரும் அதை எடுத்து உதவாத / அவசர உலகத்தின் மனிதநேயமின்மையை\" கல்யாண்ஜி எதன் மூலம் தோலுரிக்கிறார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கடுமையான வசைச்சொற்கள் மூலம்", "B": "'அக்கறை' என்னும் அமைதியான, நுட்பமான கவிதை வரிகளின் மூலம்", "C": "அரசியல் முழக்கங்கள் மூலம்", "D": "நீதிமன்ற வழக்குகள் மூலம்"}, "explanation": "சாலையில் தக்காளி உருண்டு சிதறும் எளிய காட்சியை வைத்து, பிறருக்கு உதவ நேரமில்லாத அவசர உலகத்தின் மனிதநேயப் பற்றாக்குறையையும் அக்கறையின்மையையும் 'அக்கறை' கவிதை மூலம் மென்மையாகச் சாடுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Through what medium does Kalyanji highlight the lack of empathy in today's rushed society where rolled tomatoes from a cycle fall neglected on the street?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Through harsh polemical vitriol", "B": "Through his subtly sensitive modern poem 'Akkarai'", "C": "Through political agitational slogans", "D": "Through legal litigation"}, "explanation": "'Akkarai' portrays the neglect of fallen tomatoes as a poignant symbol of humanity's missing compassion."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 178, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 178", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "akkarai", "poem_theme"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q063", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "vannadasan-short-story-collections", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "வண்ணதாசன் எழுதிய சிறுகதைத் தொகுப்புகளுள் பொருந்தாத ஒன்றைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்:", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கலைக்க முடியாத ஒப்பனைகள்", "B": "தோட்டத்துக்கு வெளியிலும் சில பூக்கள்", "C": "காற்று வாங்கப் போனேன் (பொருந்தாதது)", "D": "பெயர் தெரியாமல் ஒரு பறவை"}, "explanation": "கலைக்க முடியாத ஒப்பனைகள், தோட்டத்துக்கு வெளியிலும் சில பூக்கள், சமவெளி, பெயர் தெரியாமல் ஒரு பறவை, ஒரு சிறு இசை ஆகியவை வண்ணதாசனின் சிறுகதைத் தொகுப்புகள் ஆகும். 'காற்று வாங்கப் போனேன்' பொருந்தாதது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the short story collection that was NOT authored by fiction master Vannadasan:", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kalaikka Mudiyaatha Oppanaigal", "B": "Thottathukku Veliyilum Sila Pookkal", "C": "Kaatru Vaanga Ponaen (Does not belong)", "D": "Peyar Theriyaamal Oru Paravai"}, "explanation": "'Kaatru Vaanga Ponaen' is not Vannadasan's work; the others are his acclaimed story anthologies."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 179, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 179", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "vannadasan", "works"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q064", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kalyanji-father-thi-ka-si", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கல்யாண்ஜியின் தந்தையாரான புகழ்பெற்ற தமிழ்த் திறனாய்வாளர் யார்? (இவரும் சாகித்திய அகாதெமி விருது பெற்றவர்)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வல்லிக்கண்ணன்", "B": "தி. சோ. வேணுகோபாலன்", "C": "க.நா. சுப்பிரமணியம்", "D": "தி. க. சிவசங்கரன் (தி.க.சி.)"}, "explanation": "கல்யாண்ஜியின் தந்தையார் மூத்த முற்போக்கு இலக்கியத் திறனாய்வாளரான தி. க. சிவசங்கரன் (தி.க.சி.) ஆவார். இவரும் சாகித்திய அகாதெமி விருது பெற்ற பெருமைக்குரியவர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who was Kalyanji's father, an eminent Tamil progressive literary critic who was also a Sahitya Akademi laureate?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vallikkannan", "B": "Ti. So. Venugopalan", "C": "Ka. Naa. Subramanyam", "D": "Thi. Ka. Sivasankaran (Thi.Ka.Si. - தி.க.சி.)"}, "explanation": "His father was veteran critic Thi. Ka. Sivasankaran (Thi.Ka.Si)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 179, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 179", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "kalyanji", "father_thikasi"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q065", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kurunthogai-opening-lines", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"நசை பெரிது உடையர் நல்கலும் நல்குவர் / பிடிபசி களைஇய பெருங்கை வேழம்...\" - இப்பாடல் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள சங்க நூல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "குறுந்தொகை (பாடல் 37)", "B": "நற்றிணை", "C": "அகநானூறு", "D": "ஐங்குறுநூறு"}, "explanation": "இப்பாடல் எட்டுத்தொகை நூல்களுள் ஒன்றான குறுந்தொகையில் 37-வது பாடலாக இடம்பெற்றுள்ளது. பாலை பாடிய பெருங்கடுங்கோ இயற்றியது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which Sangam classical anthology contains the famous verse starting 'Nasai perithu udaiyar nalkalum nalkuvar / pidipasi kalaiya perungkai vezham...'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kurunthogai (Song 37 - குறுந்தொகை)", "B": "Natrinai", "C": "Akananuru", "D": "Ainkurunuru"}, "explanation": "This verse is verse 37 of Kurunthogai, composed by Paalai Paadiya Perungadungko."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 180, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 180", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "kurunthogai", "verse_source"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q066", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kurunthogai-nature-imagery", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "குறுந்தொகைப் பாடலில் ஆண் யானை (வேழம்) தன் பெண் யானையின் (பிடி) பசியைப் போக்க என்ன செய்ததாகக் காட்சிப்படுத்தப்பட்டுள்ளது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "குளத்துத் தாமரைத் தண்டுகளைப் பறித்துக் கொடுத்தது", "B": "யா மரத்தின் மெல்லிய கிளையை முறித்து, அதன் பட்டையை உரித்துத் தந்தது", "C": "கரும்புத் தோட்டத்தை அழித்து உணவு தேடியது", "D": "காட்டுப் பழங்களைப் பறித்துக் கொடுத்தது"}, "explanation": "பாடலின் பொருள்: ஆண் யானை தன் பெண் யானையின் பசியைப் போக்குவதற்காக யா மரத்தின் நாரை/பட்டையை உரித்து அன்போடு அளிக்கும் காட்சியைத் தலைவன் செல்லும் பாலை வழியில் காண்கிறான்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the Kurunthogai poem, what does the male elephant (Vezham) tenderly do to appease the hunger of the female elephant (Pidi)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Uproots water lilies from a lake", "B": "Peels the fibrous bark of the Yaa tree's tender branch to feed her", "C": "Raids a sugarcane farm", "D": "Gathers wild forest berries"}, "explanation": "The male elephant peels the bark of the Yaa tree branch to assuage the hunger of his mate."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 180, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 180", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "kurunthogai", "nature_imagery"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q067", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kurunthogai-vocab-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "குறுந்தொகைச் சொற்களையும் அவற்றுக்குரிய பொருள்களையும் பொருத்துக:\n1. நசை - அ. பெண் யானை\n2. பிடி - ஆ. விருப்பம்\n3. வேழம் - இ. உரிக்கும்\n4. பொளிக்கும் - ஈ. ஆண் யானை", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1-அ, 2-ஆ, 3-இ, 4-ஈ", "B": "1-ஆ, 2-இ, 3-ஈ, 4-அ", "C": "1-ஆ, 2-அ, 3-ஈ, 4-இ", "D": "1-ஈ, 2-அ, 3-ஆ, 4-இ"}, "explanation": "சரியான பொருத்தம்: 1. நசை - விருப்பம் (ஆ), 2. பிடி - பெண் யானை (அ), 3. வேழம் - ஆண் யானை (ஈ), 4. பொளிக்கும் - உரிக்கும் (இ). எனவே 1-ஆ, 2-அ, 3-ஈ, 4-இ."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Kurunthogai vocabulary items with their correct meanings:\n1. Nasai - a. Female elephant (பிடி)\n2. Pidi - b. Desire / Longing (விருப்பம்)\n3. Vezham - c. Peels / Strips (உரிக்கும்)\n4. Polikkum - d. Male elephant (ஆண் யானை)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d", "B": "1-b, 2-c, 3-d, 4-a", "C": "1-b, 2-a, 3-d, 4-c (1-ஆ, 2-அ, 3-ஈ, 4-இ)", "D": "1-d, 2-a, 3-b, 4-c"}, "explanation": "Nasai = Desire, Pidi = Female elephant, Vezham = Male elephant, Polikkum = Strips/peels."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 181, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 181", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "kurunthogai", "vocab_matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q070", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kurunthogai-thinai-thurai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாடப்பகுதியில் உள்ள குறுந்தொகைப் பாடல் (பாடல் 37) எத்திணைக்குரியது? அதன் துறை யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "முல்லைத்திணை; தலைவன் பாசறைக்கண் தலைவியை நினைத்தது", "B": "பாலைத்திணை; தலைவன் பிரிவின்கண் ஆற்றாளாகிய தலைவியைத் தோழி ஆற்றுவித்தது", "C": "குறிஞ்சித்திணை; சிறைப்புறமாகத் தோழி செப்பியது", "D": "மருதத்திணை; பரத்தையிற் பிரிந்துவந்த தலைவனை வாயில் மறுத்தது"}, "explanation": "திணை: பாலைத்திணை (பிரிவும் பிரிவு நிமித்தமும்). துறை: பொருள் தேடப் பிரிந்து சென்ற தலைவனை நினைத்து வருந்திய தலைவியை நோக்கி, 'தலைவர் செல்லும் வழியிலும் விலங்குகள் அன்போடு வாழ்வதைக் கண்டு விரைவில் திரும்பிவிடுவார்' எனத் தோழி ஆற்றுவித்தது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "To which landscape (Thinai) does this Kurunthogai verse belong, and what is its poetic situation (Thurai)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Mullai; hero reminiscing at the military camp", "B": "Paalai (desert); confidante consoling the grieving heroine separated from her departed hero", "C": "Kurinji; confidante speaking while hero listens behind the hedge", "D": "Marutham; refusing entry to the wandering hero"}, "explanation": "Landscape: Paalai (separation). Situation: The confidante reassures the pining heroine that nature's tender love will prompt the hero's early return."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 181, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 181", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "kurunthogai", "thinai_thurai"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
