{"id": "9th-u9-q114", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "uvamai-ani-definition", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஒரு செய்யுளில் உவமானமும் உவமேயமும் வந்து, அவற்றுக்கிடையே உவம உருபு வெளிப்படையாக வருவது எவ்வகை அணியாகும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உருவக அணி", "B": "உவமை அணி", "C": "எடுத்துக்காட்டு உவமை அணி", "D": "வேற்றுமை அணி"}, "explanation": "ஒப்பிடப்படும் பொருள் (உவமேயம்), ஒப்பாகக் கூறப்படும் பொருள் (உவமானம்), அவற்றுக்கிடையே போல, புரைய, அன்ன, அற்று போன்ற உவம உருபுகள் வெளிப்படையாக வருவது 'உவமை அணி' எனப்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "When the subject (Upameya) and the analogue (Upamana) appear with the comparative particle overtly expressed, what poetic figure is formed?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Metaphor (Uruvagam)", "B": "Simile (Uvamai Ani - உவமை அணி)", "C": "Exemplary Simile", "D": "Contrast / Distinction"}, "explanation": "A simile (Uvamai Ani) overtly states the comparison using explicit particles like 'pola' or 'atru'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edit