{"id": "10th-u4-q078", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_4", "lesson_id": "perumal_thirumozhi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "poetic_sentiment", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நோயாளி மருத்துவனிடம் காட்டும் அன்பை இறைவனிடம் ஆழ்வார் காட்டும் அன்போடு ஒப்பிடும் நயம் எவ்வகை அணிக்குச் சான்றாகும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வேற்றுமை அணி", "B": "எடுத்துக்காட்டு உவமை அணி / உவமை அணி (போல் உருபு வெளிப்பட்டு வந்ததால் உவமை அணி)", "C": "வஞ்சப்புகழ்ச்சி அணி", "D": "சிலேடை அணி"}, "explanation": "\"நோயாளன் போல்\" என \"போல்\" என்னும் உவம உருபு வெளிப்படையாக வந்துள்ளதால் இது \"உவமை அணி\" ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Because the comparison particle \"Poal\" is explicitly used in \"Noyaalan poal\", which figure of speech is demonstrated?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vetrrumai Ani", "B": "Simile (Uvamai Ani)", "C": "Vanchappugazhchi Ani", "D": "Siledai Ani"}, "explanation": "The overt presence of the comparison particle \"Poal\" constitutes an Uvamai Ani (Simile)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 78, "chapter": null, "sectio