{"id": "10th-u5-q063", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_5", "lesson_id": "neethi_venba", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "poem_soul_companion", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நீதி வெண்பா பாடலின்படி மனிதனின் உயிருக்கு எப்போதும் பிரியாத சிறந்த அரிய துணையாய் நின்று இன்பம் பயப்பது எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பொன் பொருள்", "B": "உற்றார் உறவினர்", "C": "கல்வி (மெய்க்கல்வி)", "D": "அரசாட்சி"}, "explanation": "\"உயிர்க்கு அரிய துணையாய் இன்பம் பயக்கும் கல்வியை நெஞ்சில் போற்று\" என்று செய்குதம்பிப் பாவலர் கல்வி ஒன்றையே உயிருக்கு அழியாத உற்ற துணையாகக் குறிப்பிடுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to Neethi Venba, what serves as the supreme, infallible companion of the human soul conferring lasting joy?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Material gold", "B": "Kinsfolk", "C": "Education / True Knowledge (Kalvi)", "D": "Monarchical power"}, "explanation": "Education is hailed as the soul's ultimate companion granting everlasting joy."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 103, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference