{"id": "10th-u7-q091", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "silappathikaram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thalaikkol_deity_embodiment", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தலைக்கோலை நாட்டிய மேடையில் வைத்து பூசிக்கும்போது அது எந்தத் தெய்வத்தின் மகனாகப் பாவித்து வணங்கப்பட்டது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வருணனின் மகன்", "B": "சூரியனின் மகன்", "C": "இந்திரனின் மகன் சயந்தன்", "D": "குபேரனின் மகன்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: தலைக்கோலானது இந்திரனின் மகனான \"சயந்தன்\" எனப் பாவிக்கப்பட்டு, நன்னீராட்டி, மலர் தூவி மங்கலமாக வணங்கப்பட்டது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "When the Thalaikkol was ceremonially sanctified on stage, which celestial persona was it consecrated as?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Son of Varuna", "B": "Son of Surya", "C": "Jayantha, son of Indra (Sayandhan)", "D": "Son of Kubera"}, "explanation": "The Thalaikkol was venerated as Jayantha, the son of Indra."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 161, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 161", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["சிலப்பதிகாரம்", "தலைக்கோல் தெய்வம்", "சயந்தன்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u7-q092", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "silappathikaram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "madhavi_royal_reward", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மாதவியின் தலைசிறந்த நாட்டியத்தைக் கண்டு வியந்த சோழ மன்னன் அவளுக்கு வழங்கிய பொன் மாலையின் மதிப்பு எவ்வளவு?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நூறு பொற்காசுகள்", "B": "ஐந்நூறு கழஞ்சு பொன்", "C": "ஆயிரம் வராகன்", "D": "ஆயிரத்தெட்டுக் கழஞ்சு பொன் (1008 கழஞ்சு பொன்)"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் வரி: \"ஆயிரத் தெண்கழஞ்சு பொன் பெற்று...\" சோழ மன்னன் மாதவிக்குத் \"தலைக்கோலரிவை\" என்ற பட்டத்தோடு, ஆயிரத்தெட்டுக் கழஞ்சு பொன் மதிப்புள்ள மாலையைப் பரிசளித்தான்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What was the immense value of the golden necklace awarded to Madhavi by the Chola king after her debut?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "100 gold coins", "B": "500 Kazhanju gold", "C": "1,000 Varahan", "D": "1,008 Kazhanju gold (Aayirathen kazhanju pon)"}, "explanation": "The monarch gifted her a garland valued at 1,008 Kazhanju gold."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 162, "chap