{"id": "10th-u7-q094", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "silappathikaram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "stage_dimensions_stick", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சிலப்பதிகார அரங்கேற்று காதையில் நாட்டிய அரங்கு அமைப்பதற்குப் பயன்படுத்தப்பட்ட மூங்கில் கோலின் அளவு என்ன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பத்து விரல் அளவு", "B": "நான்கு விரல் அளவு கொண்ட ஒரு பெருவிரல் மடக்குடன், இருபத்து நான்கு விரல் நீளம் கொண்ட ஒரு முழக்கோல்", "C": "பன்னிரண்டு விரல் அளவு", "D": "ஐம்பது விரல் அளவு"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: ஒரு விண் பெருவிரலின் 24 விரல் அளவு கொண்ட முழக்கோலினால் அளந்து, எட்டுக்கோல் அகலமும், ஏழுக்கோல் நீளமும், ஒருக்கோல் உயரமும் கொண்ட நாட்டிய அரங்கம் அமைக்கப்பட்டது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What was the standardized measurement of the bamboo rod (Kool) used to construct the dance auditorium?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "10 finger-widths", "B": "A span measuring 24 finger-breadths based on an auspicious middle knuckle gauge", "C": "12 finger-widths", "D": "50 finger-widths"}, "explanation": "The stage was measured with a rod of 24 finger-breadths: 8 rods wide, 7 rods long, and 1 rod high."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 160, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 160", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["சிலப்பதிகாரம்", "அரங்கின் அளவு", "முழக்கோல் 24 விரல்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u7-q095", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "silappathikaram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "musical_ensemble_artists", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மாதவியின் நாட்டியத்திற்குப் பின்னணியாக இசைத்த இசைக்கலைஞர்களுள் \"தண்ணுமையாசிரியன்\" என்பவர் எக்கருவியை இசைப்பவர்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "புல்லாங்குழல்", "B": "யாழ்", "C": "மத்தளம் / மிருதங்கம் (தோற்கருவி)", "D": "நாதசுவரம்"}, "explanation": "தண்ணுமை என்பது மத்தளம் அல்லது மிருதங்கத்தைக் குறிக்கும். பாடலின் தாளத்திற்கு ஏற்பத் தண்ணுமை வாசிப்பவர் தண்ணுமையாசிரியன் ஆவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Madhavi's royal musical ensemble, which instrument was mastered by the \"Thannumai Aasiriyan\"?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Bamboo Flute", "B": "Yaazh lute", "C": "Maddhalam / Mridangam (Barrel percussion drum)", "D": "Nadaswaram"}, "explanation": "Thannumai signifies the primary barrel drum, maddhalam/mridangam."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 161, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 161", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["சிலப்பதிகாரம்", "தண்ணுமையாசிரியன்", "மத்தளம்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u7-q096", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "silappathikaram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "double_dance_tradition", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மாதவி நாட்டிய நன்னூல் முறைப்படி கற்றுத் தேர்ந்த இருவகை ஆடல் மரபுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நாட்டுப்புற ஆடல், நவீன ஆடல்", "B": "தெருக்கூத்து, கரகாட்டம்", "C": "மயிலாட்டம், காவடியாட்டம்", "D": "அகக்கூத்து மற்றும் புறக்கூத்து (அல்லது வசைக்கூத்து, புகழ்க்கூத்து / வேத்தியல், பொதுவியல்)"}, "explanation": "அரசன் முன்னிலையில் ஆடப்படும் வேத்தியல் கூத்து, பொதுமக்கள் காணும் பொதுவியல் கூத்து ஆகிய இருவகை ஆடல் மரபுகளிலும் மாதவி தலைசிறந்து விளங்கினாள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which dual classical performance traditions did Madhavi thoroughly master according to the Natya manuals?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Folk and pop styles", "B": "Therukkoothu and Karagam", "C": "Peacock and Kavadi dances", "D": "Vethiyal (Courtly royal dance) and Podhuviyal (Popular public dance), also termed Aham and Puram koothu"}, "explanation": "She mastered both courtly (Vethiyal) and public (Podhuviyal) dance forms."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 160, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 160", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["சிலப்பதிகாரம்", "இருவகை ஆடல்", "வேத்தியல் பொதுவியல்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u7-q097", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "silappathikaram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "twin_epics_pair", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சிலப்பதிகாரமும் மணிமேகலையும் கதையமைப்பாலும் காலத்தாலும் இணைந்து விளங்குவதால் எவ்வாறு அழைக்கப்படுகின்றன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இரட்டைக் காப்பியங்கள்", "B": "பெருங்காப்பியங்கள்", "C": "சமணக் காப்பியங்கள்", "D": "பக்தி நூல்கள்"}, "explanation": "சிலப்பதிகாரத்தின் தொடர்ச்சியாக மணிமேகலை அமைந்திருப்பதால் இவ்விரண்டும் \"இரட்டைக் காப்பியங்கள்\" என அழைக்கப்படுகின்றன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Because of their shared timeline and continuous storyline, Silappathikaram and Manimekalai are jointly hailed as:", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Irattai Kaappiyangal (The Twin Epics)", "B": "Perunkaappiyangal", "C": "Jain Epics", "D": "Bhakti Texts"}, "explanation": "They are celebrated together as the Twin Epics of Tamil."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 162, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 162", "url": null, "sour