{"id": "10th-u8-q018", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "sanga_ilakkiyatthil_aram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "nature_protection_ethics", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சங்க காலத்தில் இயற்கை மீதும் மரங்கள் மீதும் காட்டிய பேரன்பிற்குச் சான்றாக நற்றிணையில் ஒரு தலைவி எதனைத் தன் \"உடன்பிறந்த சகோதரி\" என்று பாடுகிறாள்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வாழை மரம்", "B": "புன்னை மரம் (தன் தாய் நட்டு வளர்த்த புன்னை மரம்)", "C": "மாமரம்", "D": "வேப்பமரம்"}, "explanation": "நற்றிணையில் தலைவி: \"தாயால் நட்டு வளர்க்கப்பட்ட இப்பூத்த புன்னை மரம் உனக்குத் தமக்கையாகும் (சகோதரி) என்று தாய் கூறியதால், இதன் முன் நிற்க நாணுகிறேன்\" எனப் பாடுகிறாள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Natrinai, as a testament to profound ecological kinship, which tree is tenderly addressed by a heroine as her own elder sister?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Plantain tree", "B": "Punnai tree (Alexandrian laurel nursed by her mother)", "C": "Mango tree", "D": "Neem tree"}, "explanation": "The heroine considers the blossoming Punnai tree as her own elder sister."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 178, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 178", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["சங்க இலக்கியத்தில் அறம்", "இயற்கை அறம்", "புன்னை மரம் சகோதரி"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u8-q019", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "sanga_ilakkiyatthil_aram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "senchotru_kadan_gratitude", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சங்க காலத் தமிழரின் அறச்சிந்தனைகளில் \"செஞ்சோற்றுக் கடன்\" என்பது எதனை உணர்த்துகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நெல் கடன் பெறுதல்", "B": "உணவு பரிமாறுதல்", "C": "உண்ட உணவிற்கும் உதவிய முதலாளிக்கும்/அரசனுக்கும் செய்யும் உளமார்ந்த நன்றியுணர்வும் விசுவாசமும்", "D": "விருந்துக்கு அழைத்தல்"}, "explanation": "தான் உண்ட சோற்றுக்கு விசுவாசமாக நின்று தன் உயிரையும் ஈந்து நன்றியைக் காப்பதே \"செஞ்சோற்றுக் கடன்\" என்னும் உயர்ந்த அறமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What fundamental moral ethos does the ancient concept \"Senchotru Kadan\" denote in Tamil martial culture?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Paddy loan repayment", "B": "Serving lunch", "C": "Uncompromising loyalty, devotion, and supreme sacrificial gratitude towards one whose salt/food one has eaten", "D": "Feast invitations"}, "explanation": "It denotes absolute sacrificial gratitude and loyalty towards a benefactor."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 178, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 178", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["சங்க இலக்கியத்தில் அறம்", "செஞ்சோற்றுக் கடன்", "நன்றியுணர்வு"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u8-q020", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "sanga_ilakkiyatthil_aram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "prose_summary_ethics", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "போந்தை பசுபதியின் \"சங்க இலக்கியத்தில் அறம்\" கட்டுரை உலக சமுதாயத்திற்கு உணர்த்தும் தலையாய பாடம் என்ன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பழைய இலக்கியங்களை மறந்துவிட வேண்டும்", "B": "போர்கள் மட்டுமே உலகை ஆளும்", "C": "வணிகத்தில் நேர்மை தேவையில்லை", "D": "சங்க காலத் தமிழர் போற்றிய மனிதநேயம், வாய்மை, கொடை, போரறம், இயற்கை நேயம் ஆகிய விழுமியங்களே இன்றைய உலகிற்கும் வழிகாட்டும் கலங்கரை விளக்கம்"}, "explanation": "சங்க இலக்கியத்தின் அறநெறிகள் மனித சமுதாயத்தின் அமைதிக்கும் நல்வாழ்விற்கும் காலத்தால் அழியாத உயரிய வழிகாட்டிகளாக விளங்குகின்றன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What enduring universal lesson is imparted by Pondhai Pasupathi's treatise on Sangam ethics?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Ancient literature is obsolete", "B": "Wars alone govern the world", "C": "Ethics are unnecessary in trade", "D": "The humanism, truthfulness, selfless charity, chivalry, and ecological reverence of Sangam Tamils remain timeless beacons for global civilization"}, "explanation": "Sangam ethics serve as a timeless moral compass for global civilization."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 179, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 179", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["சங்க இலக்கியத்தில் அறம்", "கட்டுரைச் சுருக்கம்", "உலக வழிகாட்டல்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u8-q021", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "gnanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "poet_name", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "10-ஆம் வகுப்பு இயல் 8 கவிதைப் பேழையில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள \"ஞானம்\" என்னும் கவிதையை இயற்றியவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தி. சோ. வேணுகோபாலன்", "B": "கண்ணதாசன்", "C": "உமா மகேஸ்வரி", "D": "குலோத்துங்கன்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: \"ஞானம்\" என்னும் அழகிய தத்துவக் கவிதையைப் படைத்தவர் கவிஞர் தி. சோ. வேணுகோபாலன் ஆவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who is the author of the philosophical poem \"Gnaanam\" featured in Standard 10 Unit 8?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Thi. So. Venugopalan", "B": "Kannadasan", "C": "Uma Maheswari", "D": "Kulothungan"}, "explanation": "Thi. So. Venugopalan composed the contemplative poem Gnaanam."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 180, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 180", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["ஞானம்", "தி. சோ. வேணுகோபாலன்", "ஆசிரியர்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u8-q022", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "gnanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "poet_native_profession", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கவிஞர் தி. சோ. வேணுகோபாலன் பிறந்த ஊர் எது? அவர் எங்கு பேராசிரியராகப் பணியாற்றினார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மதுரை - சென்னைப் பல்கலைக்கழகம்", "B": "திருவையாறு (தஞ்சை மாவட்டம்) - மணிப்பால் பொறியியல் கல்லூரியில் இயந்திரவியல் பேராசிரியராகப் பணியாற்றினார்", "C": "கும்பகோணம் - அரசு கல்லூரி", "D": "திருச்சி - தேசியக் கல்லூரி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: தி. சோ. வேணுகோபாலன் திருவையாற்றில் பிறந்தவர்; மணிப்பால் பொறியியல் கல்லூரியில் இயந்திரவியல் (Mechanical Engineering) பேராசிரியராகப் பணியாற்றியவர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What was the native place of poet Thi. So. Venugopalan, and where did he serve as an engineering professor?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Madurai - Madras University", "B": "Thiruvaiyaru (Thanjavur) - Professor of Mechanical Engineering at Manipal Institute of Technology", "C": "Kumbakonam - Govt College", "D": "Tiruchy - National College"}, "explanation": "He was born in Thiruvaiyaru and served as a Mechanical Engineering professor at Manipal."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 181, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 181", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["ஞானம்", "வேணுகோபாலன் ஊர் பணி", "திருவையாறு மணிப்பால்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u8-q023", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "gnanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "poetry_collections", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தி. சோ. வேணுகோபாலன் அவர்களின் புகழ்பெற்ற கவிதைத் தொகுதிகளுள் ஒன்று எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நட்சத்திரங்களின் தூது", "B": "மறுபயணம்", "C": "கோடைவயல் (மற்றும் மீட்சி விண்ணப்பம்)", "D": "சூரியகாந்தி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: தி. சோ. வேணுகோபாலன் அவர்களின் கவிதைத் தொகுப்பு \"கோடைவயல்\" ஆகும்; ஞானம் என்னும் கவிதை இத்தொகுப்பிலிருந்தே எடுக்கப்பட்டுள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which celebrated poetry collection by Thi. So. Venugopalan includes the prescribed poem \"Gnaanam\"?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Natchathirangalin Thoothu", "B": "Marupayanam", "C": "Kodaivayal (and Meetchi Vinnappam)", "D": "Sooriyakanthi"}, "explanation": "The poem Gnaanam is excerpted from his acclaimed anthology \"Kodaivayal\"."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 181, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 181", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["ஞானம்", "கோடைவயல்", "கவிதைத் தொகுதி"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u8-q024", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "gnanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "poetic_metaphor_dust_window", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"ஞானம்\" கவிதையில் ஜன்னலைத் திறந்து, பழைய ஏடுகளில் படிந்துள்ள தூசிகளைத் துடைத்துத் தூய்மை செய்வது எதனை உருவகப்படுத்துகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வீட்டு வேலை செய்வதை", "B": "பழைய காகிதங்களை விற்பதை", "C": "புத்தகங்களை அடுக்கி வைப்பதை", "D": "மனதில் படிந்துள்ள பழைய அறியாமைத் தூசிகளை அகற்றி, புதிய அறிவு வெளிச்சத்தை (ஞானத்தை) வரவேற்பதை"}, "explanation": "ஜன்னலைத் திறந்து தூசியைத் துடைப்பது என்பது அறியாமையை நீக்கி, புதிய அறிவையும் சிந்தனைத் தெளிவையும் தன் நெஞ்சில் ஏற்றுவதைக் குறிக்கிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the poem \"Gnaanam\", what does opening the window and dusting off ancient manuscripts symbolize allegorically?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Mere household chores", "B": "Selling old paper waste", "C": "Stacking library books", "D": "Clearing away the archaic cobwebs of ignorance from the mind to welcome the illuminating dawn of true wisdom (Gnaanam)"}, "explanation": "Dusting away grime allegorizes purging ignorance to embrace illuminating wisdom."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil