{"id": "11th_tamil_u5_q085", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_5", "lesson_id": "poetry_agananuru", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "agananuru_general", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "எட்டுத்தொகை நூல்களுள் ஒன்றான அகநானூறு பற்றிய கீழ்க்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானதைத் தேர்க:\n1. அகப்பொருள் சார்ந்த நானூறு பாடல்களைக் கொண்ட நூல்.\n2. இதன் பாடல்கள் 13 அடி சிற்றெல்லையும் 31 அடி பேரெல்லையும் கொண்ட ஆசிரியப்பாக்களால் ஆனவை.\n3. இது 'நெடுந்தொகை' என்றும் அழைக்கப்பெறும்.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்றுகள் 1, 2, 3 மூன்றும் சரியானவை", "B": "கூற்று 1 மற்றும் 2 மட்டுமே சரி", "C": "கூற்று 2 மற்றும் 3 மட்டுமே சரி", "D": "கூற்று 1 மட்டுமே சரி"}, "explanation": "அகநானூறு அகப்பொருள் சார்ந்த 400 ஆசிரியப்பாக்களைக் கொண்டது. 13 அடி சிற்றெல்லையும் 31 அடி பேரெல்லையும் கொண்டதால் இது 'நெடுந்தொகை' என்றும் அழைக்கப்படுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Select the correct statements regarding Agananuru:\n1. It contains 400 love poems.\n2. Line length ranges from 13 to 31 lines.\n3. It is also known as 'Nedunthokai'.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Statements 1, 2, 3 are all correct", "B": "Statements 1 and 2 only are correct", "C": "Statements 2 and 3 only are correct", "D": "Statement 1 only is correct"}, "explanation": "Agananuru has 400 Asiriyappa poems on Agam themes, spanning 13 to 31 lines, hence known as 'Nedunthokai'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 114, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 5, Page 114", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 5", "Poetry", "Agananuru"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u5_q086", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_5", "lesson_id": "poetry_agananuru", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "divisions_and_counts", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அகநானூற்றின் மூன்று பெரும் பிரிவுகளையும் அவற்றிலுள்ள பாடல் எண்ணிக்கையையும் பொருத்துக:\n(அ) களிற்றியானை நிரை - 1. 100 பாடல்கள்\n(ஆ) மணிமிடை பவளம் - 2. 120 பாடல்கள்\n(இ) நித்திலக் கோவை - 3. 180 பாடல்கள்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3", "B": "அ-2, ஆ-3, இ-1", "C": "அ-3, ஆ-2, இ-1", "D": "அ-2, ஆ-1, இ-3"}, "explanation": "களிற்றியானை நிரை: 1-120 (120 பாடல்கள்); மணிமிடை பவளம்: 121-300 (180 பாடல்கள்); நித்திலக் கோவை: 301-400 (100 பாடல்கள்). எனவே வரிசை: 2, 3, 1."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the three sections of Agananuru with their song counts:\n(a) Kalitriyanaipirai - 1. 100 poems\n(b) Manimidaipavalam - 2. 120 poems\n(c) Nithilakkovai - 3. 180 poems", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3", "B": "a-2, b-3, c-1", "C": "a-3, b-2, c-1", "D": "a-2, b-1, c-3"}, "explanation": "Kalitriyanaipirai has 120 poems, Manimidaipavalam has 180 poems, and Nithilakkovai has 100 poems."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corpor