{"id": "12th_tamil_u2_q257", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "nedunalvaadai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "title_significance", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘நெடுநல்வாடை’ என்னும் பெயர் காரணப் பொருளை விளக்குக:", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தலைவனைப் பிரிந்த தலைவிக்கு நீண்ட வாடையாகவும் (நெடிய வாடை), போர்க்களத்தில் வெற்றிபெறும் தலைவனுக்கு நல்வாடையாகவும் அமைவதால்", "B": "நெடுந்தொலைவு வீசும் காற்று என்பதால்", "C": "வாடைக்காலத்தில் போரிடாததால்", "D": "வாடைக்காற்றின் மணம் நறுமணமாக இருப்பதால்"}, "explanation": "பிரிவில் வாடும் தலைவிக்கு துன்பம் தரும் நெடிய வாடையாகவும், போர்க்களத்தில் கடமையாற்றும் தலைவனுக்கு வெற்றி தரும் நல்வாடையாகவும் அமைவதால் ‘நெடுநல்வாடை’ எனப்பட்டது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Explain the etymological rationale behind the dual title 'Nedu-Nal-Vaadai':", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "A prolonged agonising wind (Nedu-vaadai) to the pining queen, but an auspicious victorious wind (Nal-vaadai) to the warring king", "B": "Wind blowing from vast geographical distances", "C": "Warriors resting without campaigning in winter", "D": "Winter wind bearing sweet floral aroma"}, "explanation": "The north wind is an agonizing long chill (Neduvaadai) to the separated queen, yet an auspicious good wind (Nalvaadai) to the king fulfilling duty on the battlefield."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 32, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 2, Page 32", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 2", "Nedunalvaadai", "Title Significance"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u2_q258", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "nedunalvaadai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thinai_classification", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நெடுநல்வாடை அகப்பொருள் நூலா அல்லது புறப்பொருள் நூலா என்பதில் உரையாசிரியர்கள் கூறும் கருத்து யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "முழுக்க முழுக்க அகப்பொருள் நூல் மட்டுமே", "B": "அகப் பின்னணி கொண்டிருப்பினும், வேப்பம்பூ மாலையைக் குறிப்பிட்டு அரசனின் வீரம் பேசப்படுவதால் புறநூலாக (வாகைத்திணை) வகைப்படுத்தப்படுகிறது", "C": "முழுக்க முழுக்கப் பக்தி நூல்", "D": "நீதி நூல் மட்டுமே"}, "explanation": "பாண்டியரின் அடையாளப் பூவான வேப்பம்பூ மாலை குறிப்பிடப்பட்டதால் அக இலக்கண மரபு மீறப்பட்டுப் புறத்திணையாகிய வாகைத்திணையில் சேர்க்கப்பட்டது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How do classical commentators classify Nedunalvaadai between Akam (internal love) and Puram (external heroism)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Strictly internal subjective love poetry (Akam) alone", "B": "Though emotional theme is love separation, explicit mention of the royal Neem garland classifies it under Puram (Vaagai Thinai)", "C": "Devotional hymn alone", "D": "Didactic ethical literature"}, "explanation": "Because the royal insignia of the Pandya neem garland is mentioned, it violates strict anonymous Akam conventions and is classed under Puram (Vaagai thinai)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 32, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 2, Page 32", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 2", "Nedunalvaadai", "Thinai"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u2_q259", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "nedunalvaadai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thinai_and_thurai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நெடுநல்வாடையின் திணையும் துறையும் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வெட்சித் திணை, பாசறை நிலை", "B": "வஞ்சித் திணை, கொற்றவள்ளை", "C": "வாகைத் திணை, கூதிர்ப்பாசறை துறை", "D": "காஞ்சித் திணை, கையறுநிலை"}, "explanation": "நெடுநல்வாடை வாகைத் திணையையும், போர்க்களத்தில் கூதிர்காலத்தில் அரசன் பாசறையில் தங்கியிருக்கும் ‘கூதிர்ப்பாசறை’ துறையையும் சார்ந்தது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What are the specific Thinai (poetic landscape) and Thurai (situational context) of Nedunalvaadai?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vetchi Thinai, Paasarai Nilai", "B": "Vanchi Thinai, Kotravallai", "C": "Vaagai Thinai, Koodhirp Paasarai Thurai", "D": "Kanchi Thinai, Kaiyaru Nilai"}, "explanation": "The poem is set in Vaagai Thinai (victory/duty) and the specific sub-theme is Koodhirp Paasarai (monarch in rainy winter encampment)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 32,