{"id": "12th_tamil_u3_q540", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "thirukkural_u3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "sinam_serndharai_kolli", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘சினமென்னும் சேர்ந்தாரைக் கொல்லி இனமென்னும்\nஏமப் புணையைச் சுடும்’ - இக்குறட்பாவில் பயின்று வந்துள்ள அணி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உவமை அணி", "B": "வேற்றுமை அணி", "C": "சொல் பின்வரு நிலையணி", "D": "ஏகதேச உருவக அணி"}, "explanation": "சினத்தைத் தன்னைச் சேர்ந்தாரைக் கொல்லும் நெருப்பாக உருவகம் செய்துவிட்டு, சுற்றத்தை ஏமப் புணையாக (பாதுகாப்புப் படகாக) உருவகம் செய்ததால் ‘ஏகதேச உருவக அணி’ ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which poetic figure of speech is deployed in 'Sinamennum serndhaaraik kolli inamennum emap punaiyaich chudum'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Uvamai Ani", "B": "Vetrumai Ani", "C": "Sol Pinvaru Nilaiyani", "D": "Ekadhesa Uruvaga Ani (Partial Metaphor)"}, "explanation": "Wrath is metaphorized as fire and kinship as a life-raft without completing the counterpart metaphor, making it Ekadhesa Uruvagam."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": 