{"id": "12th_tamil_u5_q834", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_5", "lesson_id": "thevaaram_mayilai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "mayilai_kapaleeswarar_punnai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘மட்டிட்ட புன்னையங்கானல் மடமயிலை’ - இவ்வடியில் புன்னை என்பது எதனைக் குறிக்கிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வயல்வெளி", "B": "கடற்கரைச் சோலையில் பூத்துக் குலுங்கும் புன்னை மரம்", "C": "புதிய பூங்கா", "D": "நெல் வயல்"}, "explanation": "‘புன்னை’ என்பது கடற்கரை நெய்தல் நிலத்தில் மணத்தோடு பூக்கும் புன்னை மரங்களைக் குறிக்கும். மயிலாப்பூர் கடற்கரைச் சோலையாகத் திகழ்ந்தது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the line 'Mattitta punnaiyang kaanal madamayeelai', what does the term 'Punnai' botanically denote?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Paddy farm", "B": "Alexandrian laurel tree (Calophyllum inophyllum) blooming in maritime groves", "C": "Modern park", "D": "Grassland"}, "explanation": "'Punnai' is the fragrant littoral mangrove/grove tree characteristic of maritime coastal tracts like Mylapore."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 111, "cha