{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1699", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "purananooru_avvai_dhetikodan", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஔவையார் தொண்டைமானின் ஆயுதங்களை ‘பீலி அணிந்து மாலை சூட்டி நெய்யணிந்து’ அழகாக வைக்கப்பட்டிருப்பதாகக் கூறுவதன் உட்கருத்து யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஆயுதங்கள் வழிபாட்டிற்கு மட்டுமே உரியவை", "B": "தொண்டைமான் மிகவும் சுத்தமானவன்", "C": "தொண்டைமானின் ஆயுதங்கள் ஒருபோதும் போர்க்களத்தையே காணாத பயனற்ற அலங்காரப் பொருட்களாகக் கிடக்கின்றன என்னும் எள்ளல் நயம்", "D": "தொண்டைமான் படைகள் தோற்றுவிட்டன"}, "explanation": "போர்க்களத்தில் பயன்படாமல் அலங்காரப் பொருளாகக் கிடக்கும் ஆயுதங்கள் பயனற்றவை என்பதை ஔவையார் வஞ்சப்புகழ்ச்சியாகக் குத்திக் காட்டினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What subtle mocking irony is conveyed when Avvaiyar describes Thondaiman's spears as 'adorned with peacock plumes, smeared with ghee, and crowned with blossoms'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Spears are exclusively designed for temple worship", "B": "Thondaiman is an exceptionally hygienic ruler", "C": "The spears are untried museum pieces that have never witnessed the brutal test of actual combat", "D": "Thondaiman's forces have already surrendered"}, "explanation": "She subtly mocks the pristine spears as ornamental toys unbaptized in real warfare."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 87, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 87", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 5", "Irony"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1701", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thirukkural_sinam_metaphor", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘சினமென்னும் சேர்ந்தாரைக் கொல்லி இனமென்னும் ஏமப் புணையைச் சுடும்’ - இக்குறளில் பயின்றுவந்துள்ள அணி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஏகதேச உருவக அணி", "B": "முழு உருவக அணி", "C": "வேற்றுமையணி", "D": "உவமையணி"}, "explanation": "சினத்தைச் சேர்ந்தாரைக் கொல்லும் நெருப்பாகவும், சுற்றத்தை ஏமப்புணையாகவும் உருவகித்துவிட்டு, பிறவற்றை உருவகிக்காமல் விட்டதால் இது ஏகதேச உருவக அணி ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which rhetorical figure of speech (Ani) is deployed in the Kural: 'Sinamennum serndhaaraik kolli inamennum emap punaiyais sudum'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Ekadhesa Uruwaga Ani (Partial / Asymmetrical Metaphor)", "B": "Complete Metaphor (Muzhu Uruwagam)", "C": "Vetrumai Ani", "D": "Uvamai Ani"}, "explanation": "Because anger is allegorized as fire and kinship as a lifeboat without allegorizing the sea, it is Ekadhesa Uruwaga Ani."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 64, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 64", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 5", "Figures of Speech"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1704", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "nedunalvaadai_structure_balance", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நெடுநல்வாடையில் அரண்மனை அந்தப்புரத்தின் நள்ளிரவு அமைதியை நக்கீரர் எதனோடு ஒப்பிடுகிறார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "போர்க்கள முழக்கம்", "B": "சந்தைப் பேரிரைச்சல்", "C": "கடல் கொந்தளிப்பு", "D": "தூங்கும் பெண்களின் ஆழ்ந்த அமைதியும், சுவர்களில் தீட்டிய சித்திரங்களும், வாடைக் குளிரில் உறைந்த நிசப்தமும்"}, "explanation": "அந்தப்புரத்தின் நிசப்தத்தை, குளிர் நடுங்கும் பெண்களின் அசைவின்மையோடும் உறங்கும் சேடிப் பெண்களின் அமைதியோடும் கவிஞர் நேர்த்தியாகப் பாடியுள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How does Nakkeerar balance the chilling midnight silence of the royal palace apartments in Nedunalvaadai?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "With clamorous battle drums", "B": "With market bazaar commotion", "C": "With stormy ocean swells", "D": "With the hushed stillness of sleeping attendants, vibrant frescoed wall murals, and profound freezing silence"}, "explanation": "Nakkeerar vividly depicts the freezing nocturnal stillness of the palace apartments adorned with paintings."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 33, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 33", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 5", "Sangam Realism"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}

